@startuml
title UML class structure — Recovering account access
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
class PasswordReset {
  +Id : Guid
  +UserId : Guid
  +TokenHash : string
  +CreatedAt : DateTimeOffset
  +ExpiresAt : DateTimeOffset
  +UsedAt : DateTimeOffset?
  +Usable(now) : bool
  +Use(now)
}
class StaffUser {
  +Email : string
  +PasswordHash : string?
  +SessionVersion : int
  +ChangePassword(hash)
  +EndOtherSessions()
}
class PasswordResetHandler {
  +RequestAsync(ForgotPasswordCommand)
  +CheckAsync(token) : string?
  +ResetAsync(ResetPasswordCommand) : ResetPasswordResult
}
PasswordReset --> StaffUser : for
PasswordResetHandler ..> PasswordReset
PasswordResetHandler ..> StaffUser
@enduml
